# Multi-Language Request Processing

> **⚠️ DEPRECATED: This file has been split into modular components.**

## Cấu trúc mới

File gốc `multi-language-vibe-code.mdc` (~2860 lines) đã được tách thành 3 files nhỏ hơn:

### 1. [[rule_intent-detection]] (~550 lines)
- **Language Detection Engine** - Detect 13+ languages
- **Intent Analysis** - Primary intent classification (build/fix/redesign/review)
- **Domain Classification** - frontend, backend, security, payment, etc.
- **Skill Auto-Discovery** - Multilingual keyword matching
- **Clarification Flow** - Ambiguity detection và user clarification

### 2. [[vibe-code-protocol]] (~700 lines)
- **Vibe Code Execution Workflow** - Pre-review → Implementation → Post-review
- **Pre-Execution Validation Gate** - Request clarity, intent confidence, skills matched
- **Auth-Specific Handling** - Login, register, OAuth detection và security checklist
- **Vietnam Payment Handling** - MoMo, SePay, PayOS, VNPay, ZaloPay, VietQR
- **Dynamic Confidence Thresholds** - Context-aware skill matching
- **Retry Logic** - Fallback strategies (Primary → Conservative → Minimal)

### 3. [[proto_multi-language-processing]] (~300 lines)
- **Translation Layer** - Vietnamese → English matrix
- **Language Detection Patterns** - Character set và keyword detection
- **Translation Algorithm** - Semantic-preserving translation
- **Quick Reference** - Common translations

## Liên kết

| File | Mục đích | Lines |
|------|----------|-------|
| [[rule_intent-detection]] | Intent + Skill Discovery + Clarification | ~550 |
